      "text": "API / Interface\n\nREST commands + GraphQL/BFF reads\nPOST /deals, /spvs\nPOST /investors/invite\nPOST /applications/{id}/submit\nPOST /documents/generate\nPOST /signatures/envelopes\nWebhook: KYC, e-sign, payment",
