      "text": "Data Flow\n\n1 Sponsor creates SPV/deal\n2 Generate document packet\n3 Investor completes onboarding\n4 KYC/AML + accreditation review\n5 Signature + countersignature\n6 Wire/ACH confirmation\n7 Ledger + cap table updated",
