      "updated": 1782227619593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "High-level Design\n\nService-oriented modular monolith first;\nsplit\nworkflow/document/payment/compliance\nas scale grows.\nPostgres source of truth.\nS3 immutable docs.\nTemporal workflows.\nKafka/EventBridge events.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "High-level Design\n\nService-oriented modular monolith first; split workflow/document/payment/compliance as scale grows.\nPostgres source of truth.\nS3 immutable docs.\nTemporal workflows.\nKafka/EventBridge events.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aP",
      "autoResize": false
    },
