      "updated": 1782227366880,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Gateway + BFF\nRecommendation:\n• REST command APIs\n• GraphQL/BFF for reads\n• Auth0/Okta OIDC \n+ MFA\n• RBAC + row-level auth\n• Idempotency-Key \non mutations\n• Rate limits by org/IP",
      "fontSize": 18.00607898444094,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Gateway + BFF\nRecommendation:\n• REST command APIs\n• GraphQL/BFF for reads\n• Auth0/Okta OIDC \n+ MFA\n• RBAC + row-level auth\n• Idempotency-Key \non mutations\n• Rate limits by org/IP",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aZ",
