      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core Domain Services\nDeal/SPV Service: SPV, deal, \nallocations\nOnboarding: application, tasks, r\neview state\nDocument Service: templates, \nPDF packet\nCompliance: KYC/AML, KYB, a\nccreditation\nSignature: DocuSign/Dropbox Sign \nwebhooks\nPayment/Ledger: ACH/wire, \ndouble-entry ledger\n\nTechnique: transactional outbox \n+ domain events; \nno cross-service distributed \ntransaction.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Domain Services\nDeal/SPV Service: SPV, deal, \nallocations\nOnboarding: application, tasks, r\neview state\nDocument Service: templates, \nPDF packet\nCompliance: KYC/AML, KYB, a\nccreditation\nSignature: DocuSign/Dropbox Sign \nwebhooks\nPayment/Ledger: ACH/wire, \ndouble-entry ledger\n\nTechnique: transactional outbox \n+ domain events; \nno cross-service distributed \ntransaction.",
